Name: Argon2 (reference implementation)
URL: https://github.com/P-H-C/phc-winner-argon2
Version: 20190702
Revision: 62358ba2123abd17fccf2a108a301d4b52c01a7c
License: Apache-2.0
License File: LICENSE
Security Critical: yes
Shipped: yes

Description:
Argon2 password hashing (Argon2id used for the passkey vault key derivation). Dual licensed CC0-1.0 or
Apache-2.0; this project takes the Apache-2.0 side. Only the portable reference code (ref.c) is vendored: no SIMD (opt.c),
no threads (ARGON2_NO_THREADS), no tests, no CLI.

Local Modifications:
None. Files are unmodified copies of: include/argon2.h, src/{argon2,core,encoding,ref,thread}.{c,h}, src/blake2/*.
